Dialogue: 0,2:21:55.02,2:21:57.82,歌词-CN-メルト,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\blur3}{\fad(300,300)}所以
Dialogue: 0,2:21:57.90,2:21:58.90,歌词-JP-メルト,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}メルト
Dialogue: 0,2:21:57.90,2:21:58.90,歌词-CN-メルト,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\blur3}{\fad(300,300)}融化
